Basically it's futhark but with special letters for {c}, {j}, {y} and {.} .

The total number of letters is 25. comma is not used. Probably you have to 
wait for 26th anniversary to add it (zo'o) but personally i dont need it.

a TTF file and a sample are attached to this message.
Type in capital letters. In order to get {'} type "h".
Lowercase letters don't work yet.

You are free to use, share and modify this ttf file even commercially :)

The string in the example says
"COI RO DO MIHE LA RUNREMU .I .UI"

Happy anniversary! Happy logfesting!

-- 
